<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results at the US$7.6</p>
<p>million</p>
<p>Australian Open tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles, quarter-finals</p>
<p>5-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat 3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 10-Albert Costa (Spain) 6-3 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-1 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>Women's singles, quarter-finals</p>
<p>14-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Dominique van Roost (Belgium)</p>
<p>7-5 4-0 (retired)</p>
<p>4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 8-Irina Spirlea (Romania)</p>
<p>7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Women's doubles, semifinal</p>
<p>3-Lindsay Davenport (U.S) and Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat 2-Larisa</p>
<p>Neiland (Latvia) and Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) 7-5 6-3</p>
</text>
